44
00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:14.630
Mine vaata, kallis nulle kingituse
ja muidugi sulle, kellele siis veel,

45
00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:17.900
kui mitte sulle.
Sellesse vaadates näed sa ise

46
00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.075
ennast.

47
00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:41.670
Pole teda kedagi,
aja ennast püsti ära vigurda teiste

48
00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:43.739
ees.

49
00:04:43.839 --> 00:04:47.589
Kas ma vigurda?
Ma tõesti kohkusin kohe?

50
00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:53.830
Ma ei teadnudki varem, et ma
nii ilus olen.

51
00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:05.520
Miks just tema,
miks just tema endale sai

52
00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:15.130
keegi peale minu ole kena,
teie hulgas keegi. Miks just tema,

53
00:05:15.279 --> 00:05:24.940
miks just tema endale sai kegi.
Peale minu pole kena teie hulgast

54
00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:29.290
keegi miks just tema?
Miks just tema?

55
00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:36.640
Ta ju pole üldse ena endale pean
saama pegli. Kas

56
00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:43.480
