69
00:06:34.089 --> 00:06:37.679
Ning tühise, mis tühis.

70
00:06:37.779 --> 00:06:41.170
Praegu sul küll ei tarvitse kade
olla viima,

71
00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:44.680
