osa.

94
00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:22.350
Teie pole ju
ka mitte tavaline kuivaidi.

95
00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:26.770
Vaadake.

96
00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:28.300
Vaadake, sinna

97
00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:30.910
