101
00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:42.310
Kust?

102
00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:45.430
Kust me nüüd teada saame,
milliste laste juurde meil vaja

103
00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:47.579
minna on, kas

104
00:08:47.679 --> 00:08:50.800
