et ma peaksin seda tagasi küsima?

107
00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:01.459
Ei tuletanud.

108
00:09:01.559 --> 00:09:05.090
Oh saamatust.

109
00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:08.930
Ohsaamatust.

110
00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:13.130
Ma olen ilma

111
00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:15.480
Raamatust.

112
00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:22.550
Ok samust samas.

113
00:09:24.470 --> 00:09:28.150
Paole ilma.

114
00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:31.310
Raamatust.

115
00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:32.660
See

116
00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:34.835
oli

117
00:09:37.440 --> 00:09:40.610
Ta sai teate täis, kes.

118
00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:41.079
Ütleks.

119
00:09:41.179 --> 00:09:43.354
Ra, va.

120
00:09:44.809 --> 00:09:48.200
Jäi, kes ütleks küll?

121
00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:53.800
Kes ütleks küll?

122
00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:56.325
Kes ütleks kuraa?

123
00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:07.220
Unustasid laste kätte?

124
00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:09.620
Ma minestan.

125
00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:16.230
Hoog läks vist üle.
Te jätsite salaraamatu laste kätte.

126
00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:18.880
Mis see sinu asi on?

127
00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:21.640
Kui sinu ema kopsiin oleks lugeda
osanud,

128
00:10:21.740 --> 00:10:26.510
