137
00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:02.860
Ma annan sulle midagi rahu hiljem.
Hiljem.

138
00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:05.735
Üks parm tahab mind hammustada.

139
00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:09.459
Sain kätte.

140
00:11:09.559 --> 00:11:11.650
Mida ma ennem ütlesingi?

141
00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:15.770
Sa rääkisid kooli asjadest.
Ma tahaksin ütelda,

142
00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:19.610
