arvatud.

195
00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:03.500
Muidugi, mina vabandage, aga
nii see on.

196
00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:06.320
Uhkustaja selline.

197
00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:09.600
Ma olengi uhke,
sest ma olen kuninga nõuandja

198
00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:12.470
